Ananta_Upādhyāya
son of Kāśyupādhyāya, an. father of Kāśīnātha Upādhyāya, who wrote the Dharmasindhu or Dharmasindhusāra in A. D. 1791. (Dharmasindhu, L. 773. RASB. II. 1643A. III. 2212-13);
--‘Loke vyavāya’ iti padyārtha, Trav. Uni. 7215; Viṭṭhala-ṛṅmantrasārabhāṣya, Baroda 8208. BBRAS. 1115. RASB. II. 176 an. Sarvaprāyaścittaprayogasārasaṅgraha, RASB. III. 2540. Ananta died in A. D. 1774.
